msgstr "ປະເພດກົດ"

msgid "Rules"
msgstr "ກົດ"

msgid "Run scrub"
msgstr "ແລ່ນການສະຄຣັບ"

msgid ""
"Runs a preliminary hashing phase of all the new data to have an additional "
"verification before the parity computation."
msgstr "ແລ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດແຮຊເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຂອງຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການຢືນຢັນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ອນການຄຳນວນພາຣິຕີ້."

msgid "SMART"
msgstr "SMART"

msgid "Scheduled Diff"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງເວລາ Diff"

msgid "Scheduled diff"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງເວລາ Diff"

msgid "Scrub"
msgstr "ສະຄຣັບ"

msgid "Scrub frequency"
